# Phase 62 Plan 62-06 — /research/* hub build artifacts (regenerated at vite buildStart
# by scripts/build-research-rss.mjs; rss.xml is always overwritten — even an empty feed
# when the DB is unreachable). Source of truth is committed content/research/*.md +
# the Supabase research_publications table, so these public copies stay out of git.
public/research/
public/research-content/
